abstract: "Kidney-AI is a comprehensive clinical research and deep learning platform engineered for early detection, progression tracking, and risk stratification of Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD) and Acute Kidney Injury (AKI). Featuring multi-paradigm modeling combining regularized gradient boosting and residual deep tabular neural networks with SHAP-based clinical explainability, the platform provides calibrated risk estimation and automated biomarker interpretation across diverse nephrology cohorts."
